# CommonsBase_LLVM

## Overview

The LLVM/Clang C and C++ toolchain plus the llvm-mingw cross-toolchain, packaged as relocatable dk objects for every supported ABI.

`CommonsBase_LLVM` builds the LLVM 19.1.3 Clang toolchain from source
(with its zstd and libxml2 dependencies) and re-hosts the llvm-mingw
20251216 cross-toolchain, exposing both as the `Clang` and
`Toolchain.MinGW` dk modules that other packages use to compile C and C++
across the macOS, Linux, and Windows ABIs.

